meta {
  name: 4. Generate Step (LLM)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/analyses/{{analysisId}}/steps/0/generate
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Generate Step

  Calls LLM to generate output for a specific step.

  ## URL Parameters
  - :id - Analysis UUID
  - :step - Step number (0-13)

  ## Behavior
  1. Validates all previous steps are approved
  2. Sets status to "generating"
  3. Builds context from company, challenge, macro, previous steps
  4. Calls LLM (or returns mock if LLM_MOCK_MODE=true)
  5. Sets status to "generated" on success

  ## Response
  Updated AnalysisStep with ai_output populated

  ## Errors
  - 400: Previous step not approved
  - 404: Analysis or step not found
  - 500: LLM call failed

  ## Notes
  - Step 0 (challenge_refinement) has no prerequisites
  - Steps 1-13 require all previous steps approved
  - With LLM_MOCK_MODE=true, returns instant mock data
}
